      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Simplified explanation of what was said above: Avatar downloads are NOT canceled when the wearer switches avatars during a download, and vrchat then triggers avatar change every time a previously selected avatar download completes.  The fix for this would be to cancel downloads when the wearer changes avatars.\nThis issue is more noticeable on slow/ unsteady connections.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
