      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I hope they fix this bug asap. Its really annoying. And while theyre at it they might hopefully also do some other optimizations for slower connections like loading friends' avatars first, then the people closer around you and then the people that are the furthest away from you get their avatars loaded at the very end when everyone around you is loaded.",
