      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah this happens to me a lot. A workaround is to disable everything for everyone (except their voice) in safety settings and to select and do \"Show Avatar\" for people one by one to force VRChat to download avatars according to whoever it is you want to hang out with first vs. trying to just download everyone at once.",
      "viewerReactions": null
